  "name": "ranger-quills-attack-power-all-ranks-6249",
  "contract": [
    "Every authored Quills rank specifies 30% AP. Battle Shout increases melee AP and, through the Ranger stat",
    "relationship, half as much RAP. The native damage bonus must change by 0.3 times the measured melee AP gain",
    "before the authored Ranger PvE tuning. The fixture verifies the normal 20% PvE reduction (887009), so",
    "observed outgoing damage changes by 0.24 times that AP gain at every rank and return when removed. Aspect of",
    "the Hawk then changes only RAP and must not change Quills damage. A normal highest-rank cast with its",
    "Advantage prerequisite proves damage delivery."
  ],
